00:13:42.321 --> 00:13:43.345
Okay, okay.

00:13:50.596 --> 00:13:52.974
Hey, did you hear about
Kogure of the Kaisers?

00:13:52.998 --> 00:13:56.244
Yeah, he's saying that he
owns Shibuya, right?

00:13:56.268 --> 00:13:58.146
It pisses me off!

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.714
Maybe we should teach them a lesson.

00:13:59.738 --> 00:14:00.949
Leave it.

00:14:00.973 --> 00:14:02.317
Miss Miyu!

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:04.867
The time to settle this will come soon anyway.

00:14:05.244 --> 00:14:08.023
Man, Shibuya sure has degenerated.

00:14:08.047 --> 00:14:10.025
Take a look at those guys over there.

00:14:10.049 --> 00:14:12.017
They're the scum of society.

00:14:13.485 --> 00:14:16.464
| wish they'd clean those guys up
once and for all.

00:14:16.488 --> 00:14:18.033
No kidding.

00:14:18.057 --> 00:14:20.001
Those bastards.

00:14:20.025 --> 00:14:20.992
We're going after them.

00:14:23.495 --> 00:14:25.073
Later, Satsuki.

00:14:25.097 --> 00:14:27.676
I'll go home after I right
a couple more wrongs.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.498
Good luck, Ran!

00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:38.587
Why did you do that?!

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:41.156
It's a good thing the fight didn't get serious,

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.392
but if you'd injured them, your life would be...

00:14:44.416 --> 00:14:46.384
Shut up already!

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:48.530
Hurry up and let me go home.

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:50.999
| don't wanna stick around this place
any longer than I have to.

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:53.822
You're going to stay here until
your mother comes for you.

00:14:54.226 --> 00:14:55.937
She ain't coming!

00:14:55.961 --> 00:14:57.973
Not coming?

00:14:57.997 --> 00:14:59.708
Ever since she split with my old man,

00:14:59.732 --> 00:15:02.644
she only thinks about herself.

00:15:02.668 --> 00:15:04.646
She doesn't even come home.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.782
Like hell she's gonna come all the
way here to pick up her daughter.

00:15:07.806 --> 00:15:10.173
| see, I'm sorry I asked.

00:15:10.876 --> 00:15:13.121
Not like I really care.

00:15:13.145 --> 00:15:15.614
Would you just leave me alone already?

00:15:16.115 --> 00:15:19.813
No, I can't do that! I want to help you!

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:23.098
You'll just bail when things get too hot anyway.

00:15:23.122 --> 00:15:25.090
I'd never do that!

00:15:27.526 --> 00:15:29.037
I'm finally on the last one!

00:15:29.061 --> 00:15:31.029
Just one more signature
and I'll get to my goal!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:31.539
»
Big Guts

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:34.464
2 Big Guts All right! I'm gonna
get my perm before the day's over!

00:15:45.477 --> 00:15:47.844
They called us the scum of society.

00:15:49.882 --> 00:15:51.626
They said that they didn't need me.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.448
That's terrible.

00:15:56.922 --> 00:15:59.584
| just don't know anymore.

00:16:00.359 --> 00:16:02.437
What in the world am I?

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:04.406
Am I dead? Or am I alive?

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:08.264
Maybe what those old guys said
was pretty on the money.

00:16:10.002 --> 00:16:13.081
But you felt hurt by those words, right?

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:16.006
That means you have a heart.
You're not scum.

00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:17.686
Here.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.187
What's that?

00:16:19.211 --> 00:16:21.189
It's the number to my cell.

00:16:21.213 --> 00:16:24.706
If you have a problem or
just feel bad, give me a call.

00:16:27.019 --> 00:16:29.764
It's okay to depend on others
sometimes, you know?

00:16:29.788 --> 00:16:32.018
Don't keep it all bottled up inside you.

00:16:34.994 --> 00:16:37.973
Don't be ridiculous! Like hell
I'm going to rely on you!

00:16:37.997 --> 00:16:40.542
Quit getting so full of yourself, you moron!

00:16:40.566 --> 00:16:42.227
Hey!

00:16:43.469 --> 00:16:45.198
Full of myself...

00:16:47.506 --> 00:16:48.871
She got away again?!

00:16:51.877 --> 00:16:54.489
You're Miyu Yamazaki of the
Resistance, aren't you?

00:16:54.513 --> 00:16:56.481
Kogure of the Kaisers.

00:16:58.984 --> 00:17:00.577
Yamazaki...

00:17:01.754 --> 00:17:03.552
It's got nothing to do with me.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:13.975
Some of your guys got some of mine hurt.

00:17:13.999 --> 00:17:14.776
So?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.894
| figured I'd get some payback.

00:17:17.603 --> 00:17:19.628
Meaning a one-on-one with you?

00:17:20.906 --> 00:17:23.485
So, what happens if I win?

00:17:23.509 --> 00:17:25.773
I'll hand Shibuya over to you.

00:17:26.512 --> 00:17:27.589
Sounds like fun.

00:17:27.613 --> 00:17:29.858
Come on, make your move.

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:31.393
You make your move first.

00:17:31.417 --> 00:17:33.328
What?

00:17:33.352 --> 00:17:36.322
What's wrong? Hurry up and make your move.

00:17:37.289 --> 00:17:39.087
Are you scared?

00:17:40.959 --> 00:17:42.950
You bitch!

00:17:56.675 --> 00:17:58.439
Pitiful.

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:03.408
Kotobuki!

00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:06.394
| had a fun time watching your fight.

00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:08.863
You're good, Yamazaki.
That was something.

00:18:08.887 --> 00:18:09.931
Why you...

00:18:09.955 --> 00:18:14.536
Say, how about we make the next
challenger the great Ran Kotobuki?

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.804
What?

00:18:15.828 --> 00:18:19.240
We got interrupted at school,
so let's settle it here.

00:18:19.264 --> 00:18:21.790
We can tack on ownership
of Shibuya as a bonus.

00:18:22.301 --> 00:18:23.791
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.602
Kogure!

00:18:28.207 --> 00:18:29.717
Why you...

00:18:29.741 --> 00:18:31.971
Don't know when to quit, do you?!

00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:35.414
Don't get in my way!

00:18:36.982 --> 00:18:40.995
You sure don't know when to give up!
What are you, a zombie?!

00:18:41.019 --> 00:18:43.832
Kotobuki, that was none
of your business!

00:18:43.856 --> 00:18:45.967
Now, there's no one standing in our way.

00:18:45.991 --> 00:18:47.836
Come and get me. Let's settle this
fair and square.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.158
Hey, what's the matter?

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:55.743
Don't have the guts to fight me
with your bare fists?!

00:18:55.767 --> 00:18:56.978
What?!

00:18:57.002 --> 00:18:59.528
Why you! Quit being so full of it!

00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:02.836
You keep nitpicking at everything I do!

00:19:03.308 --> 00:19:06.254
People like you get on my nerves
more than anything else!

00:19:06.278 --> 00:19:08.542
Now you've done it, Yamazaki!

00:19:09.148 --> 00:19:11.559
You twisted little snot!

00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:15.063
Shuddup! Who the hell are you
calling a twisted little snot?!

00:19:15.087 --> 00:19:18.733
People who think they're the only ones
who're miserable piss me off!

00:19:18.757 --> 00:19:20.435
What the hell do you know?!

00:19:20.459 --> 00:19:22.437
Quit acting all righteous and
getting fired up about it!

00:19:22.461 --> 00:19:23.471
| was fired up from
the day I was born!

00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:25.807
I'll beat that rotten attitude
of yours back into shape!

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:27.162
You just try it!

00:19:27.733 --> 00:19:29.792
Shuddup! This'll be the end!

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:32.331
I'll turn the tables on you!

00:19:43.815 --> 00:19:47.080
| fell over a second later than you did.

00:19:47.419 --> 00:19:49.820
Damn it, I lost.

00:19:50.355 --> 00:19:53.347
Shibuya's mine now.

00:20:03.835 --> 00:20:05.860
You're finally awake.

00:20:06.872 --> 00:20:07.982
You...

00:20:08.006 --> 00:20:09.817
Where am |?

00:20:09.841 --> 00:20:13.903
| was surprised when the hospital
suddenly made a call to my cell.

00:20:14.613 --> 00:20:17.125
What? Why did they call you?

00:20:17.149 --> 00:20:18.359
This.

00:20:18.383 --> 00:20:20.428
It was in your pocket.

00:20:20.452 --> 00:20:22.630
| guess you hung onto it.

00:20:22.654 --> 00:20:24.622
I'm happy you did.

00:20:26.291 --> 00:20:29.737
Say, don't do anything reckless
like this again.

00:20:29.761 --> 00:20:33.391
There are people out there who're
worried about you, like me.

00:20:38.237 --> 00:20:40.501
| thought you were the same.

00:20:41.039 --> 00:20:43.474
| thought you were the same
as all those other people.

00:20:44.509 --> 00:20:47.376
That you would definitely give up
on me somewhere along the way.

00:20:48.447 --> 00:20:50.438
| won't do that.

00:20:51.216 --> 00:20:52.684
Not ever.

00:20:53.819 --> 00:20:55.344
Really?

00:20:57.889 --> 00:21:00.654
Then, will you pinky-swear on it?

00:21:01.059 --> 00:21:02.891
Pinky-swear?

00:21:04.529 --> 00:21:06.054
Sure.

00:21:09.635 --> 00:21:12.866
You're a weird cop.

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:14.865
Maybe I am.

00:21:27.919 --> 00:21:34.916
After that, Ran finally got to fill up her
stamp booklet and happily got her perm.

00:21:36.628 --> 00:21:40.908
But I had no idea all that had
happened while I was asleep.

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:42.510
Hey!

00:21:42.534 --> 00:21:44.412
Sorry for making you wait!

00:21:44.436 --> 00:21:46.200
Oh, Yamato!

00:21:47.639 --> 00:21:49.284
I'm sorry, did you wait long?

00:21:49.308 --> 00:21:51.119
| had to get some stuff done.

00:21:51.143 --> 00:21:52.907
Good job at work.

00:21:53.245 --> 00:21:54.289
Here you go.

00:21:54.313 --> 00:21:56.213
What's this?

00:21:57.082 --> 00:22:00.128
So, it's been exactly two years since then.

00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:04.032
Yeah, even though it feels like
it was way long ago.

00:22:04.056 --> 00:22:06.991
Two years really go by just like that.

00:22:12.097 --> 00:22:14.042
Miyu, thank you.

00:22:14.066 --> 00:22:15.810
Doesn't it have a nice tone?

00:22:15.834 --> 00:22:17.412
Yeah, it does.

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:20.715
Man, talk about hot. I can't watch this anymore.

00:22:20.739 --> 00:22:23.017
Come on, let's go, Aya.

00:22:23.041 --> 00:22:25.305
Yes, let's retreat to somewhere cooler.

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:41.669
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:41.693 --> 00:22:47.860
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:54.615
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.639 --> 00:22:59.941
And no one needs me...

00:23:00.912 --> 00:23:07.195
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.219 --> 00:23:12.988
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.558 --> 00:23:19.841
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:19.865 --> 00:23:25.580
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:31.543
| was so envious of you

00:23:31.943 --> 00:23:37.525
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.549 --> 00:23:45.066
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:51.005
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.029 --> 00:23:57.678
If only I had more courage

00:23:57.702 --> 00:24:04.108
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:06.220
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.244 --> 00:24:07.955
Next Super GALS!
The sun glaring, the heart sparkling,

00:24:07.979 --> 00:24:08.456
Next Super GALS!
summer break is finally here!

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:09.757
Summer break is finally here!

00:24:09.781 --> 00:24:12.260
It's supposed to be a season
of brilliant blue skies,

00:24:12.284 --> 00:24:13.961
but Aya's heart is all cloudy.

00:24:13.985 --> 00:24:15.563
You give midyear gifts during the summer,

00:24:15.587 --> 00:24:17.465
what Aya wants to give is the love in her heart.

00:24:17.489 --> 00:24:19.700
She wants to convey her hots for Rei
during the hot summer,

00:24:19.724 --> 00:24:21.202
but Rei isn't being receptive.

00:24:21.226 --> 00:24:24.205
Depressed and agonizing over it again,
Aya's wavering and I'm being irritated!

00:24:24.229 --> 00:24:26.197
Oh, just confess to him already, Aya!

